        },
        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "intro"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner editorial-split"
              },
              "html": "<div><p class=\"section-label\">A night at home</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Your evenings between Christmas and New Year</h2></div><div class=\"intent-prose\"><p>There are family meals, visits and nights with friends. Then there are the quieter moments: you get home, get comfortable, the Christmas lights are still on and you feel like spending a little more time together.</p>\n<p>You could catch up on your show, make something to eat or try an audio experience together in Caresse. Those evenings are part of the pleasure of the holidays too. Here are seven ideas to choose from.</p></div>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "ideas-section"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-heading"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-label"
                      },
                      "html": "Made for sharing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Seven ideas for time together over the holidays"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ol",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-grid"
                  },
                  "html": "<li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">01 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"m21 15-5-5L5 21\"/></svg></div><h3>Catch up on your show on the sofa</h3><p>An episode of the series you follow, a Christmas special or a film you love watching again: settle in with a drink and your favorite dessert. Stay a little longer if you are enjoying yourselves.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">02 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 10h8v11H8zM12 10V8M12 8c5-1 2-5 0-7-2 2-5 6 0 7Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Make dinner just for you two</h3><p>Save the big meal for Christmas if you already have one planned. Tonight, cook something simple you enjoy or order in if you do not feel like cooking. For a toast, have a glass of champagne or an alcohol-free drink of your choice.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">03 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l12-2v13M9 9l12-2\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3>Decorate the tree together</h3><p>Put some music on, get the decorations out and take your time. Have a snack or a warm drink while you put up the lights.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card featured\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">04 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14v-3a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v3\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></div><h3>Discover audio in Caresse</h3><p>On an evening when you have privacy, play a free demo together. If you enjoy the format, choose your preferences together and create a personalized session with a paid credit.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card wide\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">05 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></div><h3>Wrap presents together</h3><p>Wrap gifts for friends and family over a drink or a cup of tea. A task can become an enjoyable evening when you do it together and leave enough time.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">06 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.8A9 9 0 0 1 11.2 3 9 9 0 1 0 21 12.8Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Spend some time together after seeing everyone</h3><p>After a family meal or a night with friends, it can feel good to come home and relax together. Put on music, offer a massage if you both fancy it or just talk on the sofa.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">07 / 07</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 2.6 6.4L21 12l-6.4 2.6L12 21l-2.6-6.4L3 12l6.4-2.6L12 3ZM21 2v4M19 4h4\"/></svg></div><h3>Have a night together between the celebrations</h3><p>Christmas and New Year’s Eve may already be planned with other people. On another evening, have dinner for two and raise a glass to whatever you like. Carry on with your show or discover audio together.</p></li>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
